// Finding #64: a structural error here (an `exports capability` naming a
// capability the context never declares) used to make `bynkc check` bail
// before the test-body checker in `math_test.bynk` ever ran, silently
// dropping that diagnostic even though the editor (via `analyse_project_with`)
// still reported it. `bynkc check` must report both.
context greet {
  exports capability { Bogus }
}
